      "writtenOn": "2021-03-08T14:12:42Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Agreed. We already do half the job with the Pre\"deps\"Mutator and Pre\"arch\"Mutator. Generalizing that to allow the constraints described in the comments in preArch in build/soong/android/mutator.go to be explicitly defined would give us a lot of control.\n\nHowever, until someone needs that level of control it will probably not happen.",
